  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Add Users Individually in Capium 365 (Only if no other modules are in use)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  2:17 PM\n\n\t\tTo begin using Capium 365, it’s essential to correctly configure user access and complete their contact details. Below are the steps to follow for a smooth setup process.\n\nCapium 365 \n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > Users\n\nTo add a new user individually, click on '+ Add User' \n\nYou will now be able to enter the relevant user information. \n\nIn this page you must add: \n\n - Their first name \n - Their email ID \n - Their user permissions \n\nWe recommend checking the box at the bottom to see if you want to assign this user to all future clients and/or all existing clients as these will be automatically checked on. \n\nNote: We recommend you add your users in the My Admin section in Capium if you have other modules, otherwise you can add them in this section.  \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
